   "textLength": 316,
   "text": "These prompts may have slight variations, but they essentially ask the same question. LangCache can help you avoid calling the LLM for each of these prompts by caching the response to the first prompt and returning it for any similar prompts.\nUsing LangCache as a semantic caching service has the following benefits:",
