   ],
   "textLength": 479,
   "text": "Lower LLM costs: Reduce costly LLM calls by easily storing the most frequently-requested responses.\nFaster AI app responses: Get faster AI responses by retrieving previously-stored requests from memory.\nSimpler deployments: Access our managed service using a REST API with automated embedding generation, configurable controls, and no database management required.\nAdvanced cache management: Manage d",
