   "textLength": 375,
   "text": "LangCache reduces your LLM costs by caching responses and avoiding repeated API calls. When a response is served from cache, you don’t pay for output tokens. Input token costs are typically offset by embedding and storage costs.\nFor every cached response, you'll save the output token cost. To calculate your monthly savings with LangCache, you can use the following formula:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 3587,
    "height": 140,
    "widthFraction": 0.43,
    "leftFraction": 0.33,
    "pageFraction": 0.56,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 25,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "highlight",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 96,
   "text": "Est. monthly savings with LangCache = \n (Monthly output token costs) × (Cache hit rate)\n Copied!",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 1,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 1,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "images": [
