   ],
   "textLength": 929,
   "text": "A user sends a prompt to your AI app.\nYour app sends the prompt to LangCache through the POST /v1/caches/{cacheId}/entries/search endpoint.\nLangCache calls an embedding model service to generate an embedding for the prompt.\nLangCache searches the cache to see if a similar response already exists by matching the embeddings of the new query with the stored embeddings.\nIf a semantically similar entry",
   "counts": {
